WEBVTT

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:46.580
<b>Chains of a Warrior</b>

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:49.910
We appreciate your cooperation.

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:55.450
It won't be long before the Jirocho gang and Lady Kada control the Kabuki district.

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:57.200
Nonsense.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.550
You're merely using me to help your father take over the world.

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.960
I could say the same about you, Lady Kada.

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:10.580
As a result, the collar around my old man's neck has been released.

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:14.270
That old hag took away the flowers and freedom my father once had.

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:15.710
I'm sure that my old man will now...

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:18.470
Pay more attention to you?

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:24.480
I have a feeling that you're the one who can breathe easy now.

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:28.760
You must be overjoyed to know that the woman who stole your father from you is dead.

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:32.020
Man, this is why I hate women.

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:34.280
They're always so suspicious.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:38.340
Anyway, I'll need you to take care of Saigo's kid.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:42.370
Who knows when that sheman will betray us?

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:44.280
Pirako...

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:48.320
Jirocho doesn't see you.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:51.340
You can eliminate every obstacle in the way.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:53.850
You can spend your entire life serving him.

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:54.720
He will never turn to you...

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:55.540
Man...

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:58.430
Could you cut it out, Lady Kada?

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:04.550
If you don't shut your mouth, I'll have to make some flowers, you hag.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:11.150
<b>Greater Edo Hospital</b>

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:20.580
Madame Catherine, you should get some rest.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.840
You have been standing there for two days.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.180
I do not require any rest.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.250
Shall I take your place, Madame Catherine?

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:30.280
Kagura-chan, shouldn't you get some rest too?

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:33.930
I'm not skanky enough to go to sleep in someone else's house.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:35.330
Besides...

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:38.010
What if I wake up to find out she's...

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:40.120
She'll be fine.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.530
I'm sure she'll be fine.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.690
You should go home and get some rest.

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:47.390
She would be upset if she learned that everyone was ruining their health.

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:50.360
You have no home to return to.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:53.440
There's no place for you here.

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:54.580
Saigo-san!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.320
That fool.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:58.610
I kept telling her to escape...

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:00.170
Saigo-san...

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.250
Was that phone call...?

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:05.930
I'm not going to apologize.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.680
There was nothing I could do.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.670
And there's nothing I can do now.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.640
The day after tomorrow...

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:18.090
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan
Snack Otose</b>

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:17.770
Your place will be destroyed by the Four Devas.

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:20.840
The day after tomorrow.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:24.250
You have until then to pack up and leave this town.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.430
Wh-Why is this happening?!

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.070
Didn't you hear me?

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:31.070
There's no place for you here in this town.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:35.420
The entire Kabuki district is against you.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.480
Did they take your kid hostage?

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:38.980
Gin-san...

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:42.620
They appear to be testing me.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:47.320
There are things I'll do anything to protect.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.690
Saigo-san...

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:52.260
Pako, can you take care of them?

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:53.960
Don't worry.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.540
I'm closing up shop.

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.800
The rest is up to you.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.300
You bastard!

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.000
Otose-san was left for dead!

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.570
Her bar was destroyed!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.810
And you're just gonna turn tail and run?!

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:07.530
You're telling me to fight?

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.020
Don't make me laugh.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.060
I couldn't even take Jirocho one-on-one.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.170
When did you become so pathetic?!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.060
Damn you, Sakata!

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:17.660
If you're gonna leave, you can leave by yourself!

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.980
I won't! I won't...!

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:22.870
Do you know why Gran went by herself?

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:26.040
To protect us.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.760
If you still insist on dying,

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.140
you're free to stay behind and get yourself killed.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:33.350
Odd Jobs and Gran's bar are being closed down.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:35.330
We're just strangers now.

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:38.190
Free to do as we please.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.220
I'll be doing just that.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:40.980
Wait!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.200
Gin-san!

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.010
Sorry.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:48.850
I doubt I can protect anything now...

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:51.520
Gin-san...

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:54.150
Master Gintoki...

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:00.980
<b>Kabuki District 1st Street</b>

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:01.510
Doesn't it feel like there aren't many people around these days?

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:03.070
Didn't you know?

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:05.450
There's a war brewing around these parts.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:06.240
A war?

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:10.170
The factional rivalry between the Four Devas is heating up.

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:12.580
Everybody's too scared to come near this town.

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:14.590
Is it really that dangerous?

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:16.520
We've managed to survive everything that's come before.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.370
This is no different.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:20.630
<b>Puppet House</b>

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.630
But there are rumors that Otose's dead.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:21.620
What?!

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.770
She got in a fight with Jirocho's gang.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:27.380
And it sounds like Katsuo, one of their young leaders, also died.

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:32.590
But there's this rookie who's filling in for Katsuo.

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:36.890
I heard that she persuaded Kada and Saigo to help crush Otose-san.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:41.210
I still owe her for lending me money when I was in debt.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.530
I owe her for helping me out when I got in a fight with my wife.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:47.760
Why don't you go protect Otose-san's bar then?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.410
Don't be stupid. I'd be throwing my life away.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:55.200
In this town, the wicked live longer than the kind.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.900
Who knows when the three remaining Devas will turn on one another...

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:01.540
It's probably time to get out of this town.

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:09.050
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan
Snack Otose</b>

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:09.570
The Kabuki District, a town which accepts the clean and unclean.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:15.550
I was unable to predict that we would be chased out of this town.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:20.630
Madame Otose loved this town of good and evil.

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:22.960
But now, we can never...

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:28.120
Why must we abandon Otose's bar? Our bar...

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.320
Don't say that.

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:36.220
If we die, Otose-san will have risked her life for nothing.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:40.300
Otose-san will be moved out of the Kabuki district hospital tomorrow.

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:43.340
We'll be able to visit her every day.

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:46.800
Anyway, we'll have to stay away from the Kabuki district.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:50.590
As long as we're alive, we can always start...

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:54.720
Start over...

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:57.140
S-Start...

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.090
Huh? That's strange...

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.210
Why am I crying?

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.930
Huh?

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:26.380
So you couldn't take on the Four Devas.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:32.020
I didn't think our boss would actually attack Otose.

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:37.280
You probably thought you could calm things down by saving my life, but tough luck.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.400
Nobody can stop this war.

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:44.410
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.950
I wasn't trying to save your life.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.290
I just needed you to spill your guts.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.710
Let's get those guts out of you.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:53.260
What?! What do you wanna know?!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:56.910
Why were you surprised that Jirocho attacked Gran?

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.660
You didn't know?

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:03.020
The boss and Otose have known each other since they were kids.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.880
You could say they were childhood friends.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:08.080
The boss was a pretty naughty kid,

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:12.350
but Otose was there to straighten him out every time he tried something.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:15.720
Even after he got into organized crime,

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:20.520
Otose was the only one who stood by him and tried to straighten him out.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:27.340
As a result, the boss became a vigilante who was popular enough to be considered a leader of the town.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:31.560
Jirocho, man among men, would never have existed without Otose.

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:35.180
At the time, nobody could defeat the boss in a fight.

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:40.670
But, there was one man who managed to triumph over the boss once.

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:45.280
Tatsugoro Terada, a cop who was also a leader of the town

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:47.150
and Otose's husband.

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:51.750
A man who was strong in a fight and stuck to his ideals.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:54.460
Everyone had to love him.

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:56.890
Cop and vigilante.

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:59.820
They got in a fight once because of their different positions,

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.760
but they both fought to protect their town.

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:06.700
It wasn't long before they became friends.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.490
But there was one problem.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:13.730
They were in love with the same woman.

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:20.240
The boss backed down because he wanted Otose to be happy,

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:24.000
since he figured a vigilante wouldn't be able to provide that happiness.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:29.250
But Tatsugoro got himself killed, which left Otose alone.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.380
And he died in the middle of a battle,

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.860
taking a bullet that was meant for the boss.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:40.640
<b>Doromizu Gang</b>

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:43.270
When the boss returned from the war, his wife and daughter were waiting for him.

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:47.870
But the boss paid no attention to his daughter.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:52.360
He was willing to do anything, no matter how underhanded it was, for the sake of business.

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:59.160
He said that he didn't have the right to be a father or a vigilante.

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:05.120
Who was it, what was it, that drove the boss to give up all he had to stay in this town?

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:09.970
Now that he's struck down the old lady, I'm not really sure.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:13.000
That said, I'm one of them.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:16.530
If it's for the boss who took me in, or his daughter,

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:19.620
I'm willing to have a hole in my gut.

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.120
That's my duty.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:26.920
But was this really the right thing to do?

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:31.180
Will this really make them happy?

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:35.280
They're never gonna be happy...

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.220
...'cause I'm gonna crush them.

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.960
So you were putting on a show for the kids.

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:41.700
You don't stand a chance by yourself.

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:45.450
I can't go back on my word.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.830
Joe Schmo, take care of Gran.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:49.000
What?! Why?!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.670
You always return the favor, seven for three.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:59.840
Shouldn't you stay here to watch this old woman pass on?

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:01.900
Gintoki...

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:05.750
I don't want to see...

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.860
...you die.

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:15.160
Gran, I promise to pay off the rent.

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:17.390
So sit tight.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:24.690
How did it feel to cut down the woman you loved?

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:31.350
How did it feel to manipulate a bunch of old men and women?

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.440
That's harsh.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.750
I did it all for your sake.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:41.180
Next, you'll have Saigo destroy Otose's bar.

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:43.320
What a waste of time...

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:46.010
Did that vixen put you up to it?

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.470
Of course not.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:50.520
This is part of the plan.

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:54.860
There are many people left in this town who were involved with Otose.

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.890
We'll use this chance to flush them out.

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.680
Saigo happens to be one of them.

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:02.970
Will it really work?

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:10.410
And you don't need to worry. The old woman's buddies aren't in this town anymore.

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:13.410
The watchdog's chains have been snapped.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:18.870
You intend to keep your promise to not harm anyone else?

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:20.650
It's no use.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.090
That person was never chained.

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:29.180
You took him to be an obedient dog who could be chained?

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:33.490
I guarantee that Bro will come.

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:37.340
You were watching?

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:38.980
I was watching.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.650
When you failed to finish off Otose too...

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:46.990
When you cut her down so she wouldn't be dragged into this war...

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:50.270
You don't need to worry.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:53.690
I understand that there's no point in focusing on Otose.

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:58.740
It's not that simple to explain what it is that chains you to this town.

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:00.700
I figured it out.

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.860
You're just like him.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:08.720
But I'm going to protect her in your stead.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.460
Jirocho...

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:17.100
Take care of her... Take care of our town...

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:22.370
Both of you are chained to this town by the same thing.

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:26.380
A promise made to a certain man.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:29.450
An iron vow of your own choosing.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.790
The chains of a warrior.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:36.310
Both of you are animals bound by the same chain.

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:38.040
But...

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:45.760
One has experienced loss, but accepted the responsibility and continues to protect this town.

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.960
The other has experienced loss,

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:54.730
but has abandoned the responsibility and chosen to protect this town by using force to conquer it.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:59.800
Two beasts whose interests clash, despite sharing the same goal.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:03.730
Now, who will be the last man standing over the Kabuki district?

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.730
Don't worry.

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:10.240
I've already made up my mind.

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.980
I'll be joining you on your rampage.

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:18.870
I promise to help you take over this town.

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:22.880
So once this is finished,

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:27.790
you'll come back to me, won't you?

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:31.900
You...

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.900
Where do you think you're going?

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:44.700
With Otose-san's mementos of her husband...

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.900
Why are you here?

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:50.390
You're the one who said we could do as we please.

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:52.160
Take us with you.

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:53.970
We can help you fight.

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:57.170
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:01.180
I'm just here because Gran told me to pick this up for her.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.530
Enough already...

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:05.930
Neither of you get it...

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:10.650
If you shoulder the burden alone and leave us behind...

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.640
How are we supposed to be happy you saved our lives?

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:18.640
How are we supposed to be happy that Gran saved us if she's gone?

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:24.650
If you're gone, life won't be any fun!

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:29.170
Life doesn't need to be fun.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:34.160
I just want you to live.

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:38.040
I don't want to go through that again.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:42.210
I don't want anyone to die.

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:48.880
Aren't you supposed to be Gintoki Sakata?

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:52.800
The man who's let so much slip away, who's failed to protect so much...

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:55.170
...but swore that he would never run away from his responsibilities!

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:57.520
Didn't you promise her husband?!

00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:00.690
Once you've decided to protect something, you'll protect it to the very end!

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:03.230
Isn't that what makes you Gintoki Sakata?!

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:06.640
So what if Otose-san's life was in danger?!

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:08.760
This isn't enough to kill Otose-san off!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:09.950
Isn't enough to kill us off!

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:11.580
Isn't enough to kill you off!

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:14.990
Because you're going to protect us!

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:18.490
Because we're going to protect you!

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:22.750
Isn't that what Odd Jobs is about?

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:28.850
Isn't that how the three of us protected so much over the years?

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:35.140
We have not lost anything yet.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:39.540
So you must not lose your soul.

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:42.140
Catherine-san, Tama-san...

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.270
Master Gintoki...

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:47.770
You have protected us many times.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:51.610
No matter how dire or hopeless the situation was...

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:53.920
We trust you.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.160
So it's your turn to trust us.

00:17:57.710 --> 00:17:59.520
We can do this together.

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:03.210
We can protect Otose-san's home, our home.

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:07.170
<b>Kabuki District 1st Street</b>

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:07.850
Protect the town which brought us together.

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:13.340
Sorry, pops.

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:16.500
I bought these for you,

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.930
but there probably won't be any left over.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.770
In return, I'll make another promise.

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:28.110
We promise to protect everything which was dear to you.

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.780
Thanks, pops,

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:40.330
for leading me to these assholes.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:51.240
What's with that group of men or women or both or neither?

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.660
It's the Jirocho's gang and Saigo's people!

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:55.550
Th-There's gonna be a war!

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.510
Why is this happening?

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.640
Don't say anything.

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:02.390
Mama's the one who's hurting the most.

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:04.850
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan</b>

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:07.310
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan
Snack Otose</b>

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:10.360
Let's get started then!

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:13.480
Make a lot of noise for Otose!

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:15.190
Wait, young lady!

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:16.790
The store banner is up!

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.070
<b>Otose</b>

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:18.810
H-How can this be?!

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:20.420
Th-This early in the morning?!

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:21.980
They work too hard!

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:23.540
You're missing the point!

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:26.620
Why is the store banner up when Otose and everyone else is...?

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.330
Could it be...

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:32.340
Y-You're...!

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:35.460
Sorry, but could you come back later?

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:37.500
The place is booked.

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:39.980
I feel like drinking by myself.

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:41.970
Without any interruptions.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:42.550
What are you...?

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:46.640
Don't come any closer.

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:48.990
The hell are you talking about?!

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.740
Didn't you hear me?

00:19:57.130 --> 00:20:02.620
I told you to keep your stinkin' pig feet out of this place.

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:03.950
Pako!

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:07.120
I knew you would come, Bro.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.170
Eh?!

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:12.380
You're gonna take on the entire Kabuki District?!

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:14.380
The entire Kabuki District?

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:15.750
Don't make me laugh.

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:18.670
You fools aren't even part of this town.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:22.090
You're no different from the dogshit on the side of the road.

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:28.230
All I need from the Kabuki District is right here.

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:30.940
Our Kabuki District...

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:32.690
...can be found...

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:34.650
...right here.

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:37.140
Crush us if you can.

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:40.340
We're not letting any of you into our town.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:41.640
Pako!

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:43.240
Please stop this!

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:45.780
We don't want to fight you!

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.390
Funny.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.070
It's very strange.

00:20:49.070 --> 00:20:53.120
It makes me sick to have to fight friends.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:57.800
Yet I felt relieved when I saw your face.

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:00.080
Of course.

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:03.010
It wouldn't be right if you weren't here.

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:04.090
What are you...?

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:08.080
Assmi, it would be rude to say anything.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.350
That's right!

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:11.270
There's nothing left to say.

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:17.860
Bro and Saigo-san are both protecting what's dear to them.

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:21.380
You shouldn't be talking.

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:24.860
Not when you're the one who took what was dear to me.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:29.160
I'm not going to apologize. After all...

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:33.170
I'm here to protect what's dear to me.

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:37.290
I'll steal and destroy what's dear to others...

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:40.580
...if that's what's needed to take him back.

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:44.960
I must pity you, daughter of Jirocho.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:50.620
The swing of a samurai's blade can silence a thousand words!

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:54.230
Warriors,

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:57.860
let us hold our conversation in a whirlwind of blood!

00:22:00.470 --> 00:22:05.640
The Otose Family will be paying our respects.

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:08.780
Let's go, bastards!

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:13.160
<b>To Be Continued...</b>

00:23:40.170 --> 00:23:45.170
<b>Next Episode: Iron Town</b>
